30:### T03 — "1971": the giant pixel numeral as a stagnation stake (22–27 s)
31-- **Mechanics:** the caption line "DESPITE THIS, CAPTIONS HAVE REMAINED UNCHANGED, SINCE 1971" first appears lettered in dissolving particles (~22 s), then the year itself lands as a screen-filling pixel numeral "1971" (~24 s) and holds. One number carries the whole stagnation claim; nothing else moves.
32-- **Why it works:** a date at that scale is a stake, not a fact — the viewer feels the 50-plus years as size. The particle dissolve into the numeral also bridges the pixel-icon register of T01 into the title.
33-- **Evidence:** ev/t024-since-1971.jpg (the numeral at full frame over the "remained unchanged" line).
